        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A walking speed that is below the lower limit of normal according to what is expected.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="es">velocidad de la marcha por debajo del límite inferior de la normalidad según lo esperado.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:PROMOT_1000001>[OPMD Clinical Registry Form] &quot;Performing a Rare Disease-Oriented Master Observational Trial&quot; initiative, European Joint Programme on Rare Diseases, https://www.promotinitiative.com/</obo:PROMOT_1000001>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Decreased walking speed</rdfs:label>
